# Auto-generated project index — regenerated on session-start + post-merge/
# post-checkout hooks (scripts/generate-project-index.sh). Tracking it created
# perpetual "modified" churn (wall-clock timestamp) and modify/modify merge
# conflicts. It is regenerated everywhere, so it is not version-controlled.
docs/project-index.md
docs/index/.state
docs/index/*.md
